{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Macaron Mash</strong>, a sweet 3D puzzle party inspired by <i>Puzzle Bobble</i>! Adorable marshmallow friends push, roll, and match colorful macarons across a pastel arena. Stack combos, dodge candy disasters like sugar winds, and trigger satisfying chain reactions as you clear the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made as a <i>tiny micro-indie project</i>, Macaron Mash is short, simple, and never time-consuming \u2014 just pure, light-hearted fun you can jump into anytime.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or challenge a friend in local 2-player duels \u2014 every match is short, chaotic, and full of laugh-out-loud moments. It\u2019s simple to learn but delightfully tricky to master: one wrong move and your tower of sweets might tumble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf6c <strong>Note:</strong> The game currently <strong>doesn\u2019t include a tutorial</strong>, but controls are simple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse &amp; Keyboard (solo play):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Click</strong> \u2192 Push macarons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Click</strong> \u2192 Pull macarons</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Stick</strong> \u2192 Move your marshmallow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Stick</strong> \u2192 Adjust camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>East Button (e.g., B on Xbox / Circle on PlayStation)</strong> \u2192 Push</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>South Button (e.g., A on Xbox / Cross on PlayStation)</strong> \u2192 Pull</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Best enjoyed with a controller</strong>, but fully playable solo with mouse and keyboard too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac I\u2019m a solo indie developer \u2014 <strong>any feedback, suggestions, or even roasting are warmly welcome!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112050/extras/9acea0ed2e684fbcdfb83296094bed62.poster.avif?t=1761895897\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112050/extras/9acea0ed2e684fbcdfb83296094bed62.webm?t=1761895897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112050/extras/9acea0ed2e684fbcdfb83296094bed62.mp4?t=1761895897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4112050?t=1761895897","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112050/e798037f2cceff22421ea62b81500395d1b24e28/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761895897","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112050/6d5354c34d217b4946ed96edf145f4dc460740f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761895897","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112050/6d5354c34d217b4946ed96edf145f4dc460740f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761895897","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welco